npc N-R02-047 8 6 W cond="UQ70_JA == 0 and (GAME_WDAY == 2 or GAME_WDAY == 5) and GAME_HOUR >= 9 and GAME_HOUR < 17 and UQ70_GUARD < 2 and UQ70_RES == 3" bark="평소 자릿세만 받아요. 사람 줄은 지웠잖아요. 지운 줄은 비싸요."
